{"id":20304,"artist":"(Enlace Madonna: http://www.arrakis.es/~dabiel)","title":"Madonna: You Must Love Me","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:14.29] Donde ire sin ti\n[00:20.36] No lo pense, no debio ser asi\n[00:25.71] Tuve el poder, tu creias en mi\n[00:30.71] Yo creia en ti\n[00:37.14] La certeza se apago\n[00:42.86] Solo soñe para sobrevivir\n[00:48.57] Y tu pasion sigue viva en mi\n[00:53.93] ¡No morira!\n[00:60.00] Sin corazon sigo amando\n[01:05.71] Mi vida se va sin querer\n[01:11.43] Intento explicarlo y no puedo\n[01:17.14] Temiendo no saber\n[01:21.07] Tu quiere me\n[01:26.79] Tu quiere me\n[01:57.14] Siempre estuviste aqui\n[02:02.86] No se porque, algo nos separo\n[02:08.57] Intentalo otra vez y demostrare\n[02:13.93] Cuanto te ame\n[02:20.00] Sin corazon sigo amando\n[02:25.71] Mi vida se va sin querer\n[02:31.43] Intento explicarlo y no puedo\n[02:37.14] Temiendo no saber\n[02:41.07] Tu quiere me\n[02:46.79] Tu quiere me\n[02:52.50] Tu quiere me\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:14.28] <00:14.28>Don <00:14.99>de <00:15.35>i <00:15.71>re <00:16.78>sin <00:17.14>ti\n[00:20.35] <00:20.35>No <00:20.71>lo <00:21.07>pen <00:21.42>se, <00:22.14>no <00:22.49>de <00:22.85>bi <00:23.21>o <00:23.57>ser <00:23.92>asi\n[00:25.71] <00:25.71>Tu <00:26.07>ve <00:26.42>el <00:26.78>poder, <00:27.85>tu <00:28.21>cre <00:28.57>i <00:28.92>as <00:29.28>en <00:29.64>mi\n[00:30.71] <00:30.71>Yo <00:31.07>cre <00:31.42>i <00:31.78>a <00:32.14>en <00:32.49>ti\n[00:37.14] <00:37.14>La <00:37.49>cer <00:37.85>teza <00:39.28>se <00:39.64>apa <00:39.99>go\n[00:42.85] <00:42.85>So <00:43.21>lo <00:43.57>so <00:43.92>ñe <00:44.99>pa <00:45.35>ra <00:45.71>so <00:46.42>bre <00:46.78>vi <00:47.14>vir\n[00:48.57] <00:48.57>Y <00:48.92>tu <00:49.28>pa <00:49.64>sion <00:50.71>si <00:51.07>gue <00:51.42>vi <00:51.78>va <00:52.49>en <00:52.85>mi\n[00:53.92] <00:53.92>¡No <00:54.28>mo <00:54.99>ri <00:55.35>r <00:55.71>a!\n[00:59.99] <00:59.99>Sin <01:00.53>co <01:01.07>ra <01:01.42